                          The Sapphire Suites
                        </p>
                        <span
                          class="text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant shrink-0"
                          >Now</span
                        >
                      </div>
                      <p
                        class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5 truncate"
                      >
                        Landlord: The viewing is confirmed for Tuesday at 2:00
                        PM.
